    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/e6833842715ed33dbc37b16250856afd.avif?t=1741197225\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong>Little Luna</strong>, you play as a brave moth who has fallen deep underground, far from the light of the surface. Guided by the mysterious power of\u00a0<strong>Luna</strong>\u2014a lost goddess of lunar light\u2014you must navigate treacherous terrain, solve intricate puzzles, and find your way back to the world above. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u00a0<strong>Luna</strong>\u00a0is more than just a guide; her magic is the key to your survival. Can you harness her power and escape the darkness?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.poster.avif?t=1741197225\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.webm?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.mp4?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when every second counts, and every mistake could lead to failure?\u00a0<strong>Little Luna</strong>\u00a0invites you into a world where logic and quick thinking become your greatest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.poster.avif?t=1741197225\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.webm?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.mp4?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through mysterious platforms, activate magical lunar blocks, and find your way through intricate puzzles. But don\u2019t think it\u2019s easy! These blocks don\u2019t just activate\u2014they can move, reshaping the level before your eyes. And time? It\u2019s never on your side. You\u2019ll need more than just brains\u2014you\u2019ll need lightning-fast reflexes. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/e6833842715ed33dbc37b16250856afd.avif?t=1741197225\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong>Little Luna</strong>, you play as a brave moth who has fallen deep underground, far from the light of the surface. Guided by the mysterious power of\u00a0<strong>Luna</strong>\u2014a lost goddess of lunar light\u2014you must navigate treacherous terrain, solve intricate puzzles, and find your way back to the world above. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u00a0<strong>Luna</strong>\u00a0is more than just a guide; her magic is the key to your survival. Can you harness her power and escape the darkness?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.poster.avif?t=1741197225\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.webm?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/591cc0131b7d0c45c0d58c5197007c15.mp4?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when every second counts, and every mistake could lead to failure?\u00a0<strong>Little Luna</strong>\u00a0invites you into a world where logic and quick thinking become your greatest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.poster.avif?t=1741197225\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.webm?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507490/extras/f4653142cd49a15e37e992af0dd55416.mp4?t=1741197225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through mysterious platforms, activate magical lunar blocks, and find your way through intricate puzzles. But don\u2019t think it\u2019s easy! These blocks don\u2019t just activate\u2014they can move, reshaping the level before your eyes. And time? It\u2019s never on your side. You\u2019ll need more than just brains\u2014you\u2019ll need lightning-fast reflexes. </p>",
    "short_description": "Little Luna\u00a0is an engaging puzzle-platformer where every step is a race against time! Help little moth to escape the dark and dangerous cave!",
